baseline = "No pre-change verification was run: the explicit ordered gate rules prohibit tests before full implementation and invoking verify_cmd by hand; the initial tree had no JVM changes and the gate ledger had no earlier runs, so no pre-change failure is claimed. The README already contained the primary API corrections at the supplied base."
